# Real Firebase config - local only. The google-services plugin natively prefers a
# build-type-specific file over the root one, so debug/release builds pick this up
# automatically; the placeholder at core-entry/google-services.json (tracked) covers
# every other build (e.g. anyone else's checkout, CI without the real file).
/core-entry/src/debug/google-services.json
/core-entry/src/release/google-services.json

# Local-only reverse-engineering tooling and shelved experiments - not part of any
# build variant, never meant to reach an exported public snapshot of this repo.
/inactive/
/tools/
